# Project conventions

## Layout

- Features under `src/features/{featureName}/` with `operations.ts` for queries/actions
- Shared UI in `src/components/` (Shadcn patterns)
- Root shell (`App.tsx` or equivalent) renders header + `<Outlet />` from `react-router-dom`
- Group `main.wasp` declarations with `//#region FeatureName` / `//#endregion`
- Document features in existing `ai/docs/*.md` (or the README domain sections). Add a new doc only when a feature outgrows the README; don’t reference files that don’t exist yet.

## Imports

- In `.ts`/`.tsx`: `wasp/...` for Wasp; **relative** paths inside `src/`
- In `main.wasp`: imports of app code must use `@src/...`
- ❌ `@wasp/...` · ❌ `@src/...` inside `.ts`/`.tsx`

## General

- TypeScript only for app code
- Install deps with `npm install` (not by stuffing them into `main.wasp`)
- After `main.wasp` / `schema.prisma` changes, restart `wasp start` if types look stale
- Keep `.cursor/rules` aligned with [ai/README.md](mdc:ai/README.md)
